// AWS Federation GetSigninToken  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1550.001, T1078.004
// Detects use of GetSigninToken, which exchanges temporary credentials for a console sign-in token (federated console access). Attackers with…
// False positives: Legitimate SSO/federation brokers and identity tooling.
// Source: rules/initial-access/get-signin-token.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="GetSigninToken" and eventSource=="signin.amazonaws.com"
